      "cooked": "<p>So, what exactly is the void? It seems to have cropped up a lot through the game. The infinite<strong> void</strong> seemingly destroyed the Scholar somehow after he became a gateway between it and our world. AA is a virtuoso of the <strong>void</strong>. Now this void has a nexus point that for whatever reason screws the crap out of the local climate of the island it's on and Akash'thyria seems to draw power from it in her promo, at some vague great cost to herself (Which is somewhat ironic considering that the void keeps throwing virtuosos at her to stop her from destroying humanity).</p><p>I don't think its much of a stretch to say that these various voids are a singular entity of some sort, and whatever the void is, it seems to have some kind of will, but other than that I'm stumped. Any theories?</p>",
